<title>USA: St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Joseph hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOSEPH 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said compared with Monday, barrows and gilts were steady. Top $58.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>Producers busy planting corn and some are holding for 60.00 money. Interior Iowa only moved 94,000 Monday but rain in the forecast for tonight and tomorrow.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-270 lbs	57.50-58.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-290 lbs	56.00-57.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-310 lbs	54.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-2     300-500 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>    US 1-3     500-550 lbs    49.00</p>
<p>		   550-700 lbs    50.00-51.00</p>
<p>    Boars:     300-700 lbs    40.00</p>
<p>		   200-300 lbs    41.00</p>
</text>
